    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me."
    },
    {
        "text": "I've reached the target destination. I have visual confirmation of the smoke signal's coordinates."
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's been a while since our last fight with the other mercenaries. We've taken some losses."
    },
    {
        "text": "But they hid plenty of supplies in the underground bunker. We won't come back empty-handed."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, yeah. The scout can go on ahead."
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll catch up soon."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Right, there was an unexpected casualty."
    },
    {
        "text": "W is dead."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_battlefield",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're talking like it was hell on earth out there, but you look perfectly fine to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or are you talking it up to get a pity bonus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, it's not like you had to go out of your way to leave camp to pick us up. Who asked you to be such a worrywart?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't give a shit about anyone. Quit projecting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If W hadn't stayed behind to create an opening for us, none of us would've made it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "...When did it happen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Two hours ago, when our communications were cut off. The squad got ambushed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "W blew apart the ruins and gave us a chance to escape. He fought until the bitter end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Poor guy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. If only he made it back to camp alive. His kill count was well past mine. He would've come out as top merc, easy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it, no point talking about that stuff now. At least he's earned his rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "With the enemy routed, we should probably bring him back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible. We can't risk exposing ourselves like that. Don't want to get caught out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would you even want to? Were you two that close? Nobody told me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He had a bunch of loot on him. That's all I care about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't that much. Some of the other guys brought in bigger hauls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "When the war ends, we can go back to the good old days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If the war ends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can sit around and commiserate later. We'd better get out of here before sunset if we don't want to be the center of attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Head back to camp and muster the troops.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm\u2014?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that an order, 'Second' Lieutenant Hoederer?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...We've lost contact with the other squads. As of right now, I'm your commanding officer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're the same rank.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ines, let's hurry back to the rendezvous point. Then we can contact the client again to renegotiate our deal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a suggestion, not an order. All right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much you think we can milk W's death for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "He was a helluva merc. Everybody knew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "At least... his death won't be in vain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, did he leave anything\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Shh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone's coming. Three o'clock. Not one of ours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just one. Get out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Sarkaz...? One of the natives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, wait... You have W's gun and knife in your hands...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who the hell are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not talking? Then, die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, hold up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She followed us here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You let her follow you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We haven't exactly been dragging our feet, but she's kept up with us purely through her own skills, even after grabbing W's gear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's an 'experienced' Sarkaz, and I may need a local guide when it's time to bounce.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Are you insane? Isn't that all the more reason to kill her right here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you want us all dead, you might as well just do it yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't dare.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What if she's an assassin? What if she leads us straight into a trap?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you forget how many people in Kazdel want your head?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? How many?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...There's one right in front of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got a huge bounty on your head. But for the time being, I'd rather it stay on your shoulders. Don't get too full of yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I appreciate your diligence and frugality, but I'm not joking around either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "She took the risk to pick up W's knife and gun, and had the stones to walk right up to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are your Arts telling you? Is she hostile?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No sane person would just take in a totally unknown Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that's the difference between you and me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "On my way back, I gave her a whole bunch of openings, and she... threw little stones at me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "An interesting display of good will, wouldn't you agree?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "According to the old ways, we might want to give her a chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "This war has thinned out our ranks. We could recruit some more Sarkaz, just as mysterious as her, but I'd rather hand-pick someone myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, she's an outsider. Our ways don't apply to\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014You know what, forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm leaving in ten minutes. I don't care how many come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you're gonna give me any more corpses to deal with, I don't care whose, you better make it quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. Quite the impatient one, aren't you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...All right, you. Listen carefully.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're holding our fallen comrade's relics there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Put them down, and you can walk out of here alive. You'll have to find somewhere else to die, but at least you'll buy yourself some extra time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your last chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Last... chance?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't think I ever had a choice. The second I turn around, you draw your blade and cut me down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "This whole time... your other hand has been on that hilt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Very good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may have seen us before, or maybe you worked for someone else. None of that concerns me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, you understand what it means to take up the weapons of the fallen, yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Disheveled Sarkaz Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, prepare to evacuate first. We'll talk details later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, go rejoin the squad\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014'W.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
